{"title":"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8db1c24a6c4d0ade195b8b098cfe96a64267735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, which of the following expressions gives the smallest value?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/6/526e03cc6dc7f36883c966484ee1214e6a5dfc32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ x + y \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ xy \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ x - y \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ x \\div y \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ y \\div x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"494\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solving for each of the answer choices, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/2/1926da3101b72023d39e5e3981e91eeb360bc0ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 4 + 2 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/b/61b08d5851189eeed2bb15485150037e4ac12213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy = 4 \\times 2 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"120\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/ccc60d0202926194a4f52c72a56ad796eb571c85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y = 4 - 2 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/b/4bb88610673e65dcbf062901928b4d103432b79a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\div y = 4 \\div 2 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/b/0abb8ee02c617d3720afb7f33d8dce5be2286f65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\div x = 2 \\div 4 = 0.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"156\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>The smallest of these is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/c/72ca1ce975bb7b46bebd55ff374cef7277552f9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } y \\div x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"89\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Without calculating the values, we can note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are positive integers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/e/aee12459adca00bae8913f31f4d3b9792e3a0f80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; y + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Thus,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/9/959c7e9816b53a8a206a0e5767cf89db037bae6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y &gt; 2y + 1 &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"152\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/9/ea9ceacfb91f01669ec613eab459d331dcca6aa9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/d/14dba8f331ec2b35d6761504d2008df2e5654a8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y &gt; y + 1 - y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"174\" height=\"17\" />, therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a59a97f72be859cf1bdccd0c114e778cf5c84c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/e/c7e80b0d94a99afcf217d7f21a76fd6115441ed6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\div y &gt; (y + 1) \\div y &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"188\" height=\"20\" /> since the numerator is greater than the denominator. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/d/fcda748b2d04c546937225997f45695decd152fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\div y &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/a/8aa89ee04b903bd02516a1f4d23040fd8b586aab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\div x &lt; y \\div (y + 1) &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"188\" height=\"20\" />, therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/5/0051e849ff619aeda55ac76db0d94146e820533e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\div y &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>The only answer choice that is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/c/72ca1ce975bb7b46bebd55ff374cef7277552f9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } y \\div x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"89\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems